cells thus linger in G1.</p><p><fig position="float" id="uro1"><label>Figure </label><caption><p>Overexpressed p107 (open boxes) makes Skp2 unstable.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1681iti3"></graphic></fig></p></body></article>